ary tabs discovery and redundant cleanup","stable browser import operation IDs and non-overwriting version queue","persistent idempotent receipt replay","move-only duplicate resolution preserves content, metadata, and AI permission"],"strictness":"always","command":["bash","script/check_browser_extension_release.sh"]},
